{"seq":15,"slug":"ecommerce-logistics","title":"电商物流","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":17,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics","rating":{"composite":3.52,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.39,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 电商物流 简介\n\n电商物流是支撑电商业务运转的核心基础设施，直接影响用户购物体验和平台运营效率。从商品入库、库存管理到订单履约、末端配送，再到退货逆向物流，每一个环节都涉及复杂的系统设计和运营优化。本知识库系统梳理电商物流的完整技术与运营体系，帮助读者构建从仓储到配送的全链路认知。\n\n本知识库适用于电商平台的技术开发者和运营管理者，包括负责物流系统开发的后端工程师、仓储运营管理人员、供应链优化分析师，以及关注用户配送体验的产品经理。\n\n全书共分为四章，从物流基础理论到逆向物流形成完整的知识闭环。\n\n第一章**物流基础**，系统讲解电商物流的核心概念、供应链管理基础知识和主流物流模式的对比分析，帮助读者建立对电商物流体系的全局认知和理论基础。\n\n第二章**仓储与履约**，深入讲解仓库管理的核心流程、库存优化策略、订单履约的全链路设计，以及仓储自动化技术的应用实践，帮助读者掌握电商物流中最核心的仓储和履约能力。\n\n第三章**末端配送**，聚焦从仓库到用户手中的最后一公里配送环节，涵盖各类配送模式的对比、路径优化算法的应用，以及配送体验的全方位提升策略，帮助读者优化物流链路中与用户直接接触的关键环节。\n\n第四章**逆向物流**，围绕退货退款和可持续物流展开，涵盖退货管理流程、退款处理机制和绿色物流实践，帮助读者完善物流体系的闭环能力，在提升用户满意度的同时控制逆向物流成本。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立物流体系的宏观认知，再通过第二章深入仓储和履约的核心环节，之后学习第三章的末端配送优化，最后通过第四章完善逆向物流体系。已有物流运营经验的读者可根据薄弱环节选择性深入。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-fundamentals","title":"物流基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/logistics-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-overview","title":"电商物流全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-basics","title":"电商供应链基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/logistics-fundamentals/supply-chain-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"logistics-models","title":"电商物流模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-and-fulfillment","title":"仓储与履约","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"warehouse-management","title":"仓库管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment/warehouse-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inventory-optimization","title":"库存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment/inventory-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"order-fulfillment","title":"订单履约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment/order-fulfillment"},{"seq":4,"slug":"fulfillment-automation","title":"仓储自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment/fulfillment-automation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"last-mile-delivery","title":"末端配送","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/last-mile-delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"delivery-models","title":"末端配送模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/last-mile-delivery/delivery-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"route-optimization","title":"配送路径优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/last-mile-delivery/route-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"delivery-experience","title":"配送体验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/last-mile-delivery/delivery-experience"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"reverse-logistics","title":"逆向物流","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"return-process","title":"退货流程设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/return-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"refund-processing","title":"退款处理体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/refund-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"after-sales-service","title":"售后服务与客户体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/after-sales-service"},{"seq":4,"slug":"returns-management","title":"退货管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/returns-management"},{"seq":5,"slug":"return-rate-optimization","title":"退货率优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/return-rate-optimization"},{"seq":6,"slug":"disposition-recovery","title":"退货商品处置与价值回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/disposition-recovery"},{"seq":7,"slug":"sustainability","title":"绿色物流与可持续发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/sustainability"}]}]}